                <div class="finding-title">Black Wins More Often: Notable Exceptions</div>
                <p>Several popular openings show Black winning more than White. The Van't Kruijs Opening (a3/b3/c3 pawn openings) shows Black winning 64.2%—likely because these are often irregular openings played by beginners. The Bowdler Attack and Old Sicilian similarly favor Black in this dataset.</p>
